  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rascal-does-not-dream-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frascal-does-not-dream-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"网站\"></a></p>\n<h1>概述</h1>\n<p>源自人气动漫/轻小说《青春猪头少年不会梦到兔女郎学姐》。享受全面重制的 Minecraft GUI 体验，包含所有可爱的角色，当然还有男主角梓川咲太。</p>\n<h1>预览 - 查看画廊以获取更多图片！</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NGWpI5eV/images/47b561f5e991e2293aa15d355b32ef15c24a291c.png\" alt=\"大型箱子菜单\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NGWpI5eV/images/802185aabcfa3257f04fa8da5babec72b139d005.png\" alt=\"铁砧菜单\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NGWpI5eV/images/27902da0f03d1c9dbbc035d24bf62548ad7e4166.png\" alt=\"锻造台菜单\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting横幅\"></a></p>\n<h3>资源包说明</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 创作者或内容制作者并使用此资源包，请在描述中添加链接指向本页面，以便他人了解您所使用的资源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上传此资源包或其任何修改版本，这也包括分发到其他任何网站。</strong>（<em>除非获得本人的明确许可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
